{"id":"wb-6-508","name":"沧浪亭","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"沧浪亭","text":"沧浪亭位于苏州城南三元坊，是现存历史最为悠久的江南园林。与狮子林、拙政园、留园并称为苏州宋、元、明、清四大园林，代表着宋朝的艺术风格。\n1982年，列为第三批江苏省文物保护单位。2000年，增补为世界文化遗产——苏州古典园林项目。2006年，被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%A7%E6%B5%AA%E4%BA%AD","revisionId":93102860,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93102860","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bb9bf66d154a611b6ca5a3c4.jpg","title":"沧浪亭·苏州·全景.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%A7%E6%B5%AA%E4%BA%AD%C2%B7%E8%8B%8F%E5%B7%9E%C2%B7%E5%85%A8%E6%99%AF.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/%E6%B2%A7%E6%B5%AA%E4%BA%AD%C2%B7%E8%8B%8F%E5%B7%9E%C2%B7%E5%85%A8%E6%99%AF.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Legolas1024","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​苏州沧浪亭全景","width":320,"height":240}}